advanceWeek.tree
├── given reentrancy attempt
│   └── it should revert with reentrancy guard
└── given no reentrancy
    ├── when limit is zero
    │   └── it should revert with NotValid
    ├── when lastProcessedWeek equals currentEpoch
    │   └── it should revert with NotValid
    └── when limit is valid and lastProcessedWeek is behind
        ├── when goal minus week is greater than limit
        │   ├── it should process only limit weeks
        │   ├── it should update weekTotals for processed weeks
        │   ├── it should sync TWL buckets with limit
        │   ├── it should update lastProcessedWeek to week plus limit
        │   └── it should emit AdvanceEpoch event
        └── when goal minus week is less than or equal to limit
            ├── it should process all pending weeks to current epoch
            ├── it should update weekTotals for all processed weeks
            ├── it should sync TWL buckets with actual processed count
            ├── it should update lastProcessedWeek to currentEpoch
            └── it should emit AdvanceEpoch event
